1. Stepsize AI : Sprint Report Creation & Technical Debt Management
  Providing concise and readable Sprint reports based on data from issue trackers like Jira and Linear. In addition, it helps the Scrum Team track, manage, and pay back technical debt.
  https://www.stepsize.com/
2. Plandek : Performance Metrics Management
  It helps Scrum Masters optimize value delivery by analyzing team performance metrics like DORA.
  https://plandek.com/
3. Otter AI: Meeting Facilitation
  This tool simplifies meeting documentation by transcribing and summarizing meetings, saving time and ensuring accurate records of discussions and action items.
  https://otter.ai/
4. Retrium: Retrospective Facilitation
  Helps Scrum Masters run structured and engaging retrospectives while ensuring continuous improvement.
  https://www.retrium.com/
5. Miro AI
  Brainstorming, Refinement, Retrospective 
  It helps the Scrum Team to brainstorm ideas, outline strategy, facilitate collaboration, create prototypes based on ideas, and create retrospective event summaries.
  https://miro.com/ai/
6. Jira Align (with AI-powered insights)
  Planning, Workflow Optimization
  It brings AI-driven analytics that provides insights into team performance, predicts bottlenecks, and improves Sprint Planning.
  https://www.atlassian.com/software/jira/align
7. TeamMood: Team Sentiment & Wellness Management
  This tool analyzes team communication and provides real-time feedback on sentiment, engagement, and overall collaboration dynamics. It helps identify potential issues like burnout or frustration early on.
  https://www.teammood.com/
8. Taskade: Estimation
  It helps Scrum Teams generate reliable task estimates quickly, enhancing accuracy and saving time.
  https://www.taskade.com/generate/ai-scrum-project-management/scrum-task-estimation
9. Easy-Peasy.AI: Writing Acceptance Criteria
  This tool uses advanced AI models to quickly generate high-quality acceptance criteria based on user inputs.
  https://easy-peasy.ai/templates/acceptance-criteria
10. Notion AI: Definition of Done Management
    It helps Scrum Teams structure and refine DoD collaboratively. It can suggest key DoD elements, highlight inconsistencies, and provide templates for improving clarity.
    https://www.notion.com/product/ai
11. ChatGPT: General Assistant
    Acts as a virtual Scrum Master assistant, offering real-time suggestions and insights.
    https://chatgpt.com/
12. QuillBot: Writing Assistant
    QuillBot can work alongside Scrum Masters to help them craft clear, polished, and professional writing— in a fraction of the time it usually takes. It is an AI tool that writes with you, not for you.
    https://quillbot.com/
